The `stuffr` binary's BSD gzip personality (crates/stuffr-cli/src/compat/gzip/bsd/)
is ported from Apple's gzip, file_cmds-479 gzip/gzip.c (FreeBSD's gzip, from
NetBSD's), and the pack decoder it uses (crates/stuffr-formats/src/pack.rs) from
gzip/unpack.c at the same tag; its foreign-format decoders from gzip/unbzip2.c,
gzip/unxz.c, gzip/unlz.c and gzip/zuncompress.c at the same tag. Their notices
follow, copied verbatim.

